Package: fastbursts
Type: Package
Title: Fast Kleinberg Burst Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Joel Yew
Maintainer: Joel Yew <joelyew@utexas.edu>
Description: A performance-optimized implementation of Jon Kleinberg's (2002) burst detection algorithm, using dynamic programming with back-pointers for linear time and memory complexity.
